  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 307.03 Establishment and Maintenance of the Immunization Registry. The department shall implement and maintain a computerized immunization registry as established in RSA 141-C:20-f in compliance with all applicable state statutes and federal laws and regulations.\n\nSource. #6830, INTERIM, eff 8-14-98, EXPIRED: 12-12-98\n\nNew. #6941, eff 1-30-99, EXPIRED: 1-30-07\n\nNew. #12163, eff 5-1-17; ss by #14010, eff 6-27-24",
